     4| * Continuous operational awareness: monitoring, incident detection &
     5| * severity classification, autonomous root-cause analysis, decision &
     6| * fix-outcome memory, architecture snapshots, confidence scoring,
     7| * protected deploy gates, telemetry ingestion, and dashboard data.
     8| *
     9| * Storage strategy: reuse the existing public.ivx_operational_memory
    10| * vector store via category + metadata.kind, and add a small dedicated
    11| * public.ivx_telemetry table for high-volume client/server telemetry.
    12| *
    13| * Safety: this module never deploys, reverts, or mutates files. The
    14| * deploy-gate decision is advisory and surfaces through owner-approved
    15| * Block 21/22 routes.
